v.lines__battle = q.array(
    'Yo! You can\'t jam out if you\'re a Pokémon Trainer!',
    'Hey, wait up! What\'s the hurry? Why the rush?',
    'What! Don\'t sneak up on me!',
    'Hey, matey! Let\'s do a little jig!',
    'Which do you find more worthy, a strong or a rare Pokémon?',
    'I wonder if you are good enough for me?',
    'I can see you\'re good. Let me see exactly how good!',
    'Trainers live to seek stronger opponents.',
    'I\'ll show you just how good you are. Not!',
    'Pokémon fight! Ready, go!',
    'I came this far looking for wild Pokémon.',
    'You have Pokémon! Let\'s start!',
    'Do you know how you can avoid getting lost in the mountains? You can bend twigs as trail markers.',
    'You have a Pokédex? I want one, too.',
    'My Pokémon techniques will leave you crying!',
    'I don\'t often come here, but I will battle you.',
    'Hit me with your best shot!',
    'I draw illustrations of Pokémon when I\'m home.',
    'Take a deep breath. Isn\'t the air delicious?',
    'Oh, yuck! I think a bug stung me!',
    'Are you a Trainer? Let\'s get with it right away!',
    'That look you gave me... It\'s so intriguing!',
    'I\'ll battle you with the Pokémon I just caught.',
    'Huh? You want to talk to me?',
    'Me? Well, okay. I\'ll play!',
    'I\'ve never seen you around. Are you good?',
    'All right! Let\'s play a game!',
    'Ha-hahah-ah-ha!',
    'I\'ve been out at a Pokémon GYM a few times. ...But I always lose.',
    'Win, lose, or draw!',
    'Competition! I can\'t get enough!',
    'Let\'s go, but don\'t cheat!',
    'Fwahaha! I have never lost!',
    'They have TMs on sale at the Celadon Dept. Store. TMs aren\'t really rare, but not many people have HMs.',
    'I raise Pokémon for protection because I live alone.',
    'I punish people who abuse Pokémon!',
    'You look strong. Let me battle you, please!',
    'You should be informed. You need strategy to win at this!'
);
v.lines__win = q.array(
    'Huh? I ran out of Pokémon!',
    'I give up! You\'re good at this!',
    'My Pokémon won\'t do!',
    'You\'re impressive!',
    'I must salute you!',
    'I lost out...',
    'I had a chance...',
    'Oh! So strong!',
    'I\'m furious!',
    'Game over!',
    'I\'m out of Pokémon!',
    'You play hard!',
    'Ohhh! I did my best!',
    'Shoot! I am so jealous!',
    'I give up! You\'re a better technician!',
    'Oh! I lost!',
    'Fired away!',
    'Whew... I\'m exhausted...',
    'If you\'d like, I can teach you how to breathe properly.',
    'It wasn\'t a bug. I cut my shin on some grass.',
    'If I had new Pokémon, I would\'ve won!',
    'Be nice!',
    'Done like dinner!',
    'This stinks... I couldn\'t beat your challenge...',
    'Things just didn\'t work...',
    'You\'re too good!',
    'Drat! Came up short!',
    'Ha-haha! Not laughing! Ha-hay fever! Haha-ha-choo!',
    'Ohh! After all my training!',
    'Atcha! Didn\'t go my way!',
    'I had a chance!',
    'Huh? That\'s not right!',
    'My first loss!',
    'Aww, bummer!',
    'Pokémon isn\'t about winning or losing for me.',
    'You don\'t seem to be a problem Trainer.',
    'I knew it! You\'re as tough as I thought!',
    'It\'s not logical!'
);
v.lines__won = q.array(
    'That totally stinks! I\'m going to catch some stronger ones!',
    'Sometimes, you can find stuff on the ground. I\'m looking for the stuff I dropped.',
    'I have to find stronger Pokémon. Where might they be?',
    'How many kinds of Pokémon do you think there are in this big world?',
    'Personally, I prefer strong and rare Pokémon.',
    'I never wanted to lose to anybody, especially to a kid...',
    'Tch! I concede, you are better than I!',
    'By fighting tough battles, you get stronger.',
    'You showed me just how good I was...',
    'Oh well, I\'ll get a Zubat as I go!',
    'You looked cute and harmless. Was I ever wrong!',
    'Whew! I\'m all sweaty now.',
    'I want to go home!',
    'When you finish your Pokédex, can I have it?',
    'In mountains, you\'ll often find ROCK-type Pokémon.',
    'I like tiny Pokémon. Big ones are too scary!',
    'I\'ll raise my Pokémon to beat yours, kid.',
    'I\'m an artist, not a fighter. I\'ll go home to draw.',
    'First, exhale. Blow everything out. When you can\'t exhale anymore, inhale the clean air! Isn\'t it refreshing?',
    'A little cut like that... A little spit\'s enough to cure it!',
    'If a Pokémon BOX on the PC gets full, just switch to another BOX.',
    'You can avoid battles by not letting Trainers see you.',
    'Trained Pokémon are stronger than the wild ones.',
    'I should bring more Pokémon with me. I\'ll feel safer that way.',
    'I want to get stronger. What\'s your secret?',
    'Are my Pokémon weak? Or, am I just bad? Which do you think?',
    'Things didn\'t work today.',
    'Haha-ha-choo! Ha-choo! Snort! Snivel!',
    'I noticed some Pokémaniacs prowling around. Can you imagine? Them?',
    'Pokémon is life! And to live is to play games!',
    'You can\'t be a coward in the world of Pokémon!',
    'I did my best. I have no regrets.',
    'You were just lucky, that\'s all.',
    'Try teaching Pokémon a move that\'s the same type as it. That apparently boosts the power of the move.',
    'I love having my Pokémon greet me when I get home. It\'s so reassuring.',
    'If you treat your Pokémon with kindness, they\'ll understand.',
    'The way you battle has given me a lot of useful data. Thanks so much!',
    'Go with... first... and... and... then...'
);
